15
00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:45.799
Yacov Manevich: at the beginning, we had to make a config change when you want to renew a TLS certificate of an order node.

16
00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:47.869
Yacov Manevich: And then, …

17
00:05:47.910 --> 00:06:07.460
Yacov Manevich: at some point, I made some change that you can renew the TLS certificate of an order node in Raft, as long as you keep the same public key, you will not need to make a config update. So, this David guy, he is essentially doing the same change.

18
00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:09.390
Yacov Manevich: Only for BFT.

19
